START
Define all drone states
Define possible actions:
    UP
    DOWN
    LEFT
    RIGHT
Initialize a random policy
Initialize V(state) = 0
REPEAT
    Policy Evaluation:
    REPEAT
        FOR each state
            V(state) =
                reward +
                discount × V(next state)
        END FOR
    UNTIL values converge
    Policy Improvement:
    Set policy_stable = TRUE
    FOR each state
        old_action = current policy
        Select action with highest expected value
        Update policy[state]
        IF old_action != new_action
            policy_stable = FALSE
        END IF
    END FOR
UNTIL policy_stable = TRUE
PRINT "Optimal Policy"
PRINT policy
END
